{"ID":"20240118151052-148zlnl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151052-148zlnl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151052-148zlnl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151053-dn2b3i2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122142400-gvaema5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:227,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122142400-gvaema5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:117,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:117\u0026#125;","title":"247伏翼(夜明砂、蝙蝠屎)","type":"doc","updated":"20240202101718"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151053-dn2b3i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151053-dn2b3i2","updated":"20240202101334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，平，无毒。治目瞑，明目，夜视有精光。久服令人喜乐、媚好、无忧。生川谷及人家屋间。一名蝙蝠，今名夜明砂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142323-6cxdtyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142323-6cxdtyu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】山洞之中，倒悬于洞顶之上。其屎供药用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142326-unx60i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142326-unx60i4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142327-9qkvtak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142327-9qkvtak"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】为散血明目要药，治障翳，青盲，夜盲，头面痈肿，疳积，瘰疬。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142329-c8d9r29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142329-c8d9r29"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】养血明日。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142332-v1fwwk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142332-v1fwwk2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】烧灰酒服可下死胎。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142330-apdqacm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142330-apdqacm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】炒服治瘰疬。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142332-yzlyxvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142332-yzlyxvf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【宗奭】治疳有效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142334-d8q9sv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142334-d8q9sv4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【时珍】治目盲障翳。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142335-qpoms9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142335-qpoms9h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般一钱至二钱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142336-8zku3m0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142336-8zku3m0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】胃肠寒之人禁忌。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142338-v5coqhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142338-v5coqhc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右虫鱼中品十七种，旧十六种，增伏翼于此。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142227-vf17g83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142227-vf17g83"}},{"ID":"20240122142339-usff9y1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142339-usff9y1"}},{"ID":"20240122142339-r945hdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142339-r945hdm","updated":"20240122142343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个就是伏翼。这个伏翼呢，就是蝙蝠的大便，你不用把袋子打开来闻。当然不是生用一定是熟用，炙过烧过以后才用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240122142344-h4afbo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142344-h4afbo2","updated":"20240202101231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《神农本草经》的原文呢，蝙蝠的大便又叫夜明砂，治疗眼睛看不到，明目这种功能。蝙蝠夜袭性的动物，所以你如果眼睛夜盲呀统统可以使用，蝙蝠。"}]},{"ID":"20240122142351-2xxx2l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142351-2xxx2l0","updated":"20240202101501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个大便，中国人很厉害，大便什么味道都知道，我看。这个蝙蝠呢，味道是辛，辛辣的味道，主发散，药性是寒的，寒凉的，所以一般来说，肠胃比较冷的人都不能吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240122142354-uv781m2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142354-uv781m2","updated":"20240202101514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】是散血明目的要药，专门治眼睛有内障，有眼翳，青盲，夜盲，都可以使用。主要的功能养血明目。伏翼很多人使用。如果炒服治瘰疬。瘰疬是脖子上，还有淋巴结肿大，脖子甲状腺肿大都属于瘰疬一种，最主要会使用它治疗眼睛看不到，治目盲，青盲，还有内障眼睛生翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240122142400-gvaema5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142400-gvaema5","updated":"20240202101718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们到这里呢，诸位可以看到，虫鱼中品，本草中品呢，有十七种。原旧十六种，增加一个伏翼在这边，和本草经加进去。诸位记得，凡是遇到虫鱼类的药，都是比较强的，比较逡的，我们用到鱼的话，淡水，都用淡水，没有用到海里的，都是淡水，湖、泽里面的鱼类。一般来说，都是比较峻的，你才会使用它。"}]}]}